<p>The amount of work put in here does not save this from being dreadfully tepid. The accompanying language document seems more like an attempt to make the article seem more impressive because you &quot;wrote a language&quot; but that accomplishes nothing if the article is lackluster. And it's lackluster.</p>
<p>World building isn't just something that can be forced. So much of this feels like trying to unnaturally create interest through information dump and it doesn't do anything to prop up the main article. It ends up feeling unnecessary and excessive.</p>
<p>Edit: Plus, I should also note that the title of this article is an instant turn off. There was a point where I thought that was funny, but then I grew up and now I don't.</p>

